---
// src/components/About.astro
---
<section id="about" class="about container">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-title">
      <h2 class="heading-font">Hi There!<br/>Pleasure to Meet You!</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="about-content">
      <p>My journey into technology is deeply rooted in my experience teaching mathematics to high school students. Breaking down complex concepts like logarithms and trigonometry into simple, digestible logic taught me a foundational problem-solving mindset.</p>
      <p>I bring this exact interdisciplinary approach into my tech stack. Whether I am architecting robust backend databases, evaluating the faithfulness of XAI models, or crafting intuitive frontend interfaces, my goal remains the same: transforming complex architectures into clear, elegant solutions.</p>
      
      <div class="action-buttons">
        <a href="/CV_Christian_Kusumadjaja.pdf" download class="btn-outline">Download CV</a>
        <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-solid">Download Portfolio (PDF)</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .about-title h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #4A3E39; /* Coklat sedikit lebih terang untuk body */
  }

  .action-buttons {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn-outline, .btn-solid {
    padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-color);
    border: 1px solid var(--text-color);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--border-color); }

  .btn-solid {
    background: var(--accent-color);
    color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-color);
  }
  .btn-solid:hover { background: #9E5645; border-color: #9E5645; }

  @media print {
    .about { 
      border-bottom: none; 
      page-break-after: always; /* Setelah About, pindah ke halaman proyek */
    }
    .action-buttons { display: none; } /* Sembunyikan tombol saat di-print */
  }
</style>